<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>You can make an offer on some Buy It Now (BIN) items in the Lively app or on Lively.com, if the seller has offers turned on.</p>
        <p>When you make an offer, the seller can <strong>accept</strong>, <strong>decline</strong>, or send a <strong>counteroffer</strong>. If it's accepted, your card will be charged and the seller will ship your item.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#how-to-make-an-offer">How to make an offer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#respond-to-counteroffer">Respond to a seller's counteroffer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#track-and-view-offers">Track and view your offers</a></li>
            <li><a href="#cancel-your-offer">Cancel your offers</a></li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="how-to-make-an-offer">How to make an offer</h2>
        <p>If the seller has enabled offers, you'll see a <strong>Make Offer</strong> button when viewing the product. You won't be charged unless the seller accepts.</p>

        <p><strong>To place an offer:</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>From the app or Lively.com, open the eligible product listing</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Make Offer</strong> (app) or <strong>Offer</strong> (web)</li>
            <li>Choose a percentage discount or enter a custom offer amount</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Continue</strong></li>
            <li>Review your offer, payment, and shipping details</li>
            <li><strong>Confirm</strong> your offer</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="text-center my-4">
            <img src="/help_centre_img/help_area/How_to_make_an_offer.png"
                 alt="How to make an offer screen in Lively app"
                 class="img-fluid" style="border-radius: 12px;" />
        </div>

        <p>You won't be charged unless the seller accepts. If your offer is accepted, you'll get an order confirmation by email.</p>
        <p>If the seller doesn't respond, your offer expires automatically after 30 days.</p>
        <p>If you make an offer during a live show, the seller can view and respond during their show.</p>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="respond-to-counteroffer">Respond to a seller's counteroffer</h2>
        <p>If the seller sends a counteroffer, you'll get a notification.</p>

        <p><strong>To review or respond:</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Go to <strong>Activity &gt; Offers</strong>.</li>
            <li>Choose the offer you want to view</li>
            <li>Select one of the following:</li>
        </ol>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Accept</strong> (you'll be charged right away).</li>
            <li><strong>Reject</strong> (the negotiation ends).</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="text-center my-4">
            <img src="/help_centre_img/help_area/respond_to_a_seller_counteroffer.png"
                 alt="Respond to a seller's counteroffer screen in Lively app"
                 class="img-fluid" style="border-radius: 12px;" />
        </div>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="track-and-view-offers">Track and view your offers</h2>
        <p>You can view all your current and past offers in the Lively app or on Lively.com.</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Select the <strong>Activity</strong> icon (chat bubble with a heart).</li>
            <li>Go to the <strong>Offers</strong> tab.</li>
            <li>(App only) Tap an offer to see more details.</li>
        </ol>

        <hr />

        <h2 id="cancel-your-offer">Cancel your offer</h2>
        <p>You can cancel an offer from the Lively app.</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the <strong>Activity</strong> icon (chat bubble with a heart).</li>
            <li>Go to the <strong>Offers</strong> tab.</li>
            <li>Tap the offer you want to cancel.</li>
            <li>Scroll down and select <strong>Cancel</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>After you cancel your offer, the status will update and the seller gets notified.</p>

